to-state mappings and pattern-order-dependent matches. The fix uses binary search to insert transitions in sorted order or update an existing entry. The regression test added by this commit compares match positions for reversed pattern orders. This plan has not been executed.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T17:20:22.465219+00:00"}
